{
  "id": "p42",
  "title": "The Embassy Mission",
  "titleZh": "使馆任务",
  "topic": "使馆撤离与文物转移",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "My editor sends me to the embassy on a sensitive task this week.",
        "zh": "我的编辑这周派我去使馆执行一项敏感任务。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A reporter usually waits outside, but this quiet attempt feels different.",
        "zh": "一名记者通常在外面等候，但这次安静的尝试感觉不同。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The following morning, a thin carrier delivers a slim white paper envelope.",
        "zh": "第二天早上，一位瘦削的送件人送来一个薄薄的白色纸信封。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Official papers indicate a dramatic shortage of basic medical aid and warm food.",
        "zh": "官方文件表明，基本医疗援助和保暖食物严重短缺。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A young immigrant on the staff bends to adjust my laces.",
        "zh": "一名年轻的移民职员弯下腰，替我系好鞋带。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Her wage is small, yet her manner stays perfectly calm all day.",
        "zh": "她的工资不高，可她的举止整天都格外平静。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "A religious collection fills a cold back room here.",
        "zh": "一间阴冷的后屋里塞满了一批宗教藏品。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A holy crown of gold is the most genuine piece inside.",
        "zh": "一顶金色的圣冠是里面最真的一件。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Workers cast a warm ray of light across its thin and dusty skin.",
        "zh": "工人们打下一道暖光，掠过它薄而蒙尘的表面。"
      },
      {
        "en": "I gain safe access and easily lift it from the stand.",
        "zh": "我获得安全许可，轻松地把它从展架上取下。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then a slow wave of cold horror makes my right hand shake badly.",
        "zh": "接着，一阵缓慢的冰冷恐惧让我右手剧烈发抖。"
      },
      {
        "en": "I tear the wrapping, and a small boot print shows below.",
        "zh": "我撕开包装，下面露出一枚小小的靴印。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "A local competitor accuses our firm of a monetary crime.",
        "zh": "本地一家竞争对手指控我们公司犯有金钱方面的罪行。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The ruling party may exploit this to block an important industrial deal.",
        "zh": "执政党可能借机阻挠一项重要的工业交易。"
      },
      {
        "en": "New sanctions follow, and the loss looks substantial for everyone in our team.",
        "zh": "新的制裁随之而来，损失对我们队里每个人来说都很可观。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My familiar guide tries to bend the rule, but fails quietly.",
        "zh": "我那位熟识的向导想变通规则，却悄无声息地失败了。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The threatening note seems to indicate a leak in my desk.",
        "zh": "那封威胁性的便条似乎表明我桌子里有泄密。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later we move the collection by night, towards a safer gate.",
        "zh": "后来我们趁夜转移藏品，朝一道更安全的大门走去。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "My department plans a quiet launch of the small rescue effort.",
        "zh": "我所在的部门计划悄悄启动这次小规模救援行动。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A reliable driver is essential for this fourteenth long desert trip.",
        "zh": "对第十四次穿越沙漠的长途行程来说，一名可靠的司机不可或缺。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We adjust the plan and hide the box near my hip.",
        "zh": "我们调整计划，把箱子藏在我髋部附近。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later the acquisition proves fundamental to our working method here.",
        "zh": "后来这笔收购证明是我们在这里工作方法的基础。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The next van brings a stock of food and clean boots.",
        "zh": "下一辆货车运来一批食物和干净的靴子。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then our wage bill stays small, but the team works perfectly well.",
        "zh": "这样我们的工资开支保持很低，但团队干得非常好。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "Mostly the staff resign, and one writes a resignation note.",
        "zh": "员工们大多辞职，其中一人写了一封辞呈。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A careful keeper must breed new stock for the next long march.",
        "zh": "一位细心的饲养员必须为下一段长途行进繁育新的牲畜。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Our factory can manufacture a tent and a heavy coat easily.",
        "zh": "我们的小厂能轻松造出一顶帐篷和一件厚外套。"
      },
      {
        "en": "That incredible result lets the mission pose as a true victory.",
        "zh": "那个难以置信的结果让这次任务装成了一场真正的胜利。"
      }
    ]
  ],
